    - Stagehand documentation: https://docs.stagehand.dev
    - Stagehand Docs MCP (Mintlify): https://docs.stagehand.dev/mcp
    - Context7 MCP (Upstash): https://github.com/upstash/context7
    - DeepWiki MCP: https://mcp.deepwiki.com/
